### =============================================
### School Project - HTTP Requests File
### =============================================

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7089
@contentType = application/json

### =============================================
### 1. Authentication Controller
### =============================================

### 1.1 Sign In (Login)

# POST {{baseUrl}}/Api/V1/Authentication/SignIn
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data
POST {{baseUrl}}/Api/V1/Authentication/SignIn  HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

UserName=aya3&Password=1234560@sC!
### 1.2 Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/Api/V1/Authentication/Refresh-Token
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

AccessToken=your_access_token_here
RefreshToken=your_refresh_token_here

### 1.3 Validate Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/Api/V1/Authentication/Validate-Token?token=eyJhbGciOiJodHRwOi8vd3d3LnczLm9yZy8yMDAxLzA0L3htbGRzaWctbW9yZSNobWFjLXNoYTI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..UjmYq8mcjIlztp0aC6yBh-prxHP319-Jicr3crHp_UU

### 1.4 Confirm Email
GET {{baseUrl}}/Api/V1/Authentication/ConfirmEmail?userId=1&code=your_confirmation_code

### 1.5 Send Reset Password Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/Api/V1/Authentication/SendResetPasswordCode?email=admin@com

### 1.6 Confirm Reset Password Code
GET {{baseUrl}}/Api/V1/Authentication/ConfirmResetPasswordCode?email=admin@com&code=your_code

### 1.7 Reset Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/Api/V1/Authentication/ResetPassword
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

Email=admin@com
Password=NewPassword123!
ConfirmPassword=NewPassword123!



### 2.1 Create New User (Register)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ApplicationUser/Api/V1/User/Create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "aya",
  "userName": "engaya",
  "email": "engayamohamed23@gmail.com",
  "address": "Mansoura, Egypt",
  "country": "Egypt",
  "phoneNumber": "01098765432",
  "password": "1234560@sC!",
  "confirmPassword": "1234560@sC!"
}

### 2.2 Get Paginated Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ApplicationUser/Api/V1/User/Paginated?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10

### 2.3 Get User By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ApplicationUser/Api/V1/User/1

### 2.4 Edit User
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/ApplicationUser/Api/V1/User/Edit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "fullName": "Ahmed Mohamed Ali Updated",
  "email": "admin@com",
  "phoneNumber": "01098765432"
}

### 2.5 Delete User
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/ApplicationUser/Api/V1/User/1

### 2.6 Change Password
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/ApplicationUser/Api/V1/User/Change-Password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "123456",
  "newPassword": "Admin@2026!",
  "confirmNewPassword": "Admin@2026!"
}

### =============================================
### 3. Authorization Controller (Roles & Claims)
### =============================================

### 3.1 Create New Role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Authorization/Create
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

Name=Teacher

### 3.2 Edit Role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Authorization/Edit
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

Id=1
Name=Supervisor

### 3.3 Delete Role
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Authorization/Delete/1

### 3.4 Get All Roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Authorization/Role/List

### 3.5 Get Role By Id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Authorization/Role/1

### 3.6 Manage User Roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Authorization/ManageUserRoles/1

### 3.7 Update User Roles
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Authorization/UpdateUserRoles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "roles": ["Admin", "Teacher"]
}

### 3.8 Manage User Claims
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Authorization/ManageUserClaims/1

### 3.9 Update User Claims
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Authorization/UpdateUserClaims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "claims": [
    { "type": "Permission", "value": "CreateStudent" },
    { "type": "Permission", "value": "EditStudent" }
  ]
}
